This should work correctly. **The OE9* callsigns likely trigger the issue indirectly:** when you enter an OE9 callsign that creates a duplicate report, the silent failure means the report is created in the database but not reflected in the UI. When you try to delete via the UI, you can't see the report to click the delete button. Meanwhile, the report exists in the database silently.

